{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6347","title":"Introducing POCO X8, the Endurance Master Delivering All-Day and Beyond Power","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8 — an endurance ace featuring longer battery life, a larger display, and an enhanced user experience designed to keep users powered, entertained, and connected all day ","view_cnt":"837","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1788004188","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/90_operatorx_operatorx_opx/29/08/2026/a5bf32342ac6531f2d4f9f8b4952f8fe.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, September 1, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e — POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8 — an endurance ace featuring longer battery life, a larger display, and an enhanced user experience designed to keep users powered, entertained, and connected all day and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional Endurance for Everyday Confidence\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAt the heart of POCO X8's marathon endurance is a fully upgraded battery with greater capacity, faster charging, and a longer lifespan. POCO X8 redefines mobile freedom with a massive 8,340mAh (typ) battery, delivering 63.2% more capacity than its predecessor.¹ Built on silicon-carbon battery technology with a 13% silicon content, it delivers high energy density and supports beyond 2-day battery life on a single charge.² The battery is also built for long-term endurance, retaining 80% or more of its capacity after 1,600 charge cycles, providing reliable performance for an equivalent of roughly six years of regular use.³ Moreover, POCO X8 has passed extensive demanding tests across extreme temperature environments, mechanical stress, and battery life cycles, earning TÜV SÜD 5-star Battery Performance Certification for strong battery reliability.⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/505_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/ab644d9de6b54194b239efc2aa87d826.jpg\" alt=\"The internal structure of a smartphone is revealed, with a golden battery showing a capacity of 8340mAh, set against a black background that highlights the energy characteristics of the battery.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eComplementing this upgraded endurance is support for 67W HyperCharge⁵ and 22.5W wired reverse charging⁶, enabling rapid power-ups while allowing the phone to serve as a portable power bank for other devices on the go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable Viewing with Large Eye-Care Display\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDesigned to maximize every moment on screen, POCO X8 packs a massive 6.83-inch 1.5K ultra-bright display, offering a more immersive field of view for entertainment, gaming, and everyday browsing. With up to 3,500 nits peak brightness across 25% of the screen,⁷ content stays clear and easy to see even under direct sunlight. Empowering this experience is a flagship-grade luminous material, delivering brighter visuals with greater power efficiency.⁸ To support comfortable viewing throughout the day, POCO X8 features TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications, allowing users to enjoy their favorite content with enhanced visual comfort for longer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/830_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/325e6acc9ff77078b9dd87f76847296c.jpg\" alt=\"A young man is riding a bicycle, holding a phone to check the map, dressed in sportswear, with a yellow sweatband on his wrist, surrounded by flat roads and green trees.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign and Durability Elevated to the Next Level\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDesigned for a modern lifestyle, POCO X8 embraces a clean, minimalist look with geometric elements and sharp lines. The middle frame adopts a sandblasting finish, presenting an improved texture and a more comfortable grip. On the front, the flat screen with narrow bezels delivers a spacious and immersive visual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAdding the finishing touch to the elegant design is exceptional durability. The device delivers industry-leading IP66, IP68, IP69, and IP69K water and dust resistance ratings⁹ to keep the phone safe across everyday scenarios. Taking this even further, POCO X8 debuts POCO's first Underwater Mode, unlocking entirely new experiences from this new perspective.¹⁰ The innovative feature is ideal for capturing fun moments with friends and family in the water, or even snapping fish inside fish tanks. On top of these, the display is protected by Corning® Gorilla® Glass Victus® 2. POCO X8 delivers excellent anti-drop and anti-scratch performance that protects the screen from direct drops of up to 3 meters.¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/465_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/29/08/2026/d42816b35220fee84dc58b98f3f9589a.jpg\" alt=\"A mobile phone is suspended against a black background, with a smooth black marble surface underneath. The design of the phone is simple, featuring two circular cameras.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Round Performance for Daily Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRunning on the Snapdragon® 6s Gen 4 Mobile Platform built on an advanced 4nm process, POCO X8 delivers solid everyday performance and enables fast app launches, smooth multitasking, and responsive task switching. An integrated Adreno GPU further enhances the experience, delivering smooth visuals for high-definition gaming and demanding 3D workloads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePowered by Xiaomi HyperOS 3,¹² POCO X8 delivers a smarter, more connected everyday experience. With Xiaomi HyperIsland¹³ for intuitive smart features and Google Gemini¹⁴ as a built-in AI assistant, it helps streamline daily tasks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor enhanced communication and connectivity, Xiaomi Offline Communication¹⁵ keeps users connected even without network coverage, ensuring seamless communication in remote areas. The device also supports up to a 300% volume boost¹⁶ for louder and more immersive audio on the go or at home.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuthentic Portraits and Smart Image Editing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8's upgraded imaging system elevates portrait quality across all scenarios to help users capture the moments with true authenticity. The 50MP main camera, equipped with both OIS and EIS, is complemented by a 16MP front camera, delivering natural-looking portraits with greater detail in diverse lighting conditions. With Dual video, users can capture both front and rear views at the same time, combining two perspectives in one recording to create more dynamic and engaging content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAfter shooting, intuitive AI editing tools like AI Glare Removal, AI Erase Pro, AI Image Expansion, AI Image Enhancement, and AI Beautify make it easy to refine every shot and create polished visual stories.¹⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8 will be available in three colors: White, Black, and Orange.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be offered in three variants: 6GB + 128GB, 8GB + 256GB, and 12GB + 256GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Data comes from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on different test environments and conditions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² The data is based on test results from POCO Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting daily use (including typical smartphone activities such as home screen use, music playback, social media, email, maps, video streaming, standby, etc.). Actual results may vary due to differences in the testing environment, software version, network conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ This is from theoretical calculations based on test data from POCO Internal Labs. Simulate daily user habits (one full charge and discharge every 1.79 days). Over 80% of the battery's capacity is retained after 1600 complete charge cycles, which corresponds to over 6 years of usage. Actual results may vary depending on testing conditions and usage habits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ The product has passed TÜV SÜD 5-star Battery Performance Certification, Certificate No.: Z2GCN 099551 0768、Z2GCN 099551 0769、Z2GCN 099551 0767、Z2GCN 099551 0770. Under laboratory conditions, the battery’s adaptability to harsh environments was tested through simulated high-temperature storage, low-temperature storage, low-temperature discharge, and temperature cycling tests ranging from -40°C to 75°C. Actual performance may vary due to differences in testing equipment, test environments, usage methods, and user habits. Under laboratory conditions, tests including simulated vibration, free fall, impact, compression, and certain collision scenarios were conducted to verify that the battery did not experience abnormal conditions such as fire, explosion, or leakage. Actual performance may vary due to differences in testing equipment, test environments, drop/impact angles, and usage methods. Based on theoretical calculations, under room-temperature conditions and simulated daily usage scenarios, the battery capacity retention rate remains ≥80% after 1,600 charge and discharge cycles. Actual results may vary due to differences in testing equipment, test environments, personal usage methods, and user habits. Under laboratory conditions, simulated 60-hour battery endurance tests were conducted. Actual battery life may vary depending on network conditions, screen brightness, volume, feature settings, application usage, and personal usage habits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ Supports up to 67W charging with PPS-compatible adapters. Actual performance may vary depending on the environment. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁶ Supports up to 22.5W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁷ Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on testing environment, and software version, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁸ Display power consumption reduction is compared with the display material used in the previous-generation product. Actual results may vary depending on usage conditions, software, and other factors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁹ Tested and certified to be resistant to splash, water, and dust in specific laboratory conditions with the IP68/IP69 ingress protection based on IEC 60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013. The IP69K is based on ISO 20653:2023. The test conditions of water resistance include: For IP68: submersion in static freshwater up to a depth of 2 meters, up to 72 hours, with a temperature delta between the water and product being 5°C or less. For IP69/IP69K: spraying the enclosure with a stream of water from a standard test nozzle; turntable speed of 5(±1) r/min; spray positions of 0°, 30°, 60°, 90°; test duration of 30 seconds per position; water flow rate of 15(±1) L/min with a water temperature of 80℃. Ingress protection is not assured if the product is subjected to environments beyond the test conditions. Not recommended to test by yourself. Not advised for beach or pool use. The warranty will not cover the liquid damage caused in environments beyond the test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate from daily wear and tear and/or physical damage or disassembly. Please refer to user's manual for full instructions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁰ Underwater Mode is a camera feature and does not extend the device's water resistance. Limited to static freshwater use at a maximum depth of 2m for up to 30 minutes. Not for professional diving, seawater, pool, or hot water. A professional waterproof case is strongly recommended. Liquid damage caused beyond test conditions is not covered by warranty.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹¹ The 3-meter drop resistance data is certified by SGS. The phone can withstand a drop from a height of 3 meters onto a smooth granite surface under SGS-standard testing conditions. Actual results may vary. As a precision electronic device, the phone is still at risk of damage if dropped. Please be careful to avoid drops and collisions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹² Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 3 features, apps and services may vary depending on regions, software version and phone model.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹³ Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Availability of specific features and services may vary depending on software version, apps, regions, and device models. Please refer to actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁴ Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC. Check responses. Setup required. Compatibility and availability vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁵ Xiaomi Offline Communication requires a SIM card and a logged-in Xiaomi account to function. It supports up to 1.5km of voice calls in open, unobstructed environments. This feature is only available for devices that support Xiaomi Offline Communication. Feature availability may vary by region. Please consult local resellers for more details. Actual call quality may vary depending on environmental conditions. Please refer to your actual experience. This feature is not designed or intended for emergency or life-saving communications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁶ Data tested by POCO Internal Labs, 300% volume boost refers to 17 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios. Please refer to the actual use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹⁷ Availability of AI features may vary based on region. Please check the official website for more information. Some of the AI Creativity Assistant features require an internet connection, and may vary by system software and Gallery Editor app versions. Please refer to actual use experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy — \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" — drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making, accelerates the company’s evolution, and refreshes the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"354","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1788266719"},"common":null}